{"c":[{"name":"20261023T141155Z-466f715437dd59f5","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: a new warehouse is built at a temp name and renamed into place after a check under the writer flock, not hard-linked, so new installs need no hard links. Schema 3-8 migrate tests use files written by DuckDB 1.5.4 and its vss.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T143437Z-5511efe16b6ad9f6","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-23: a v1.0.0 file reloads view SQL (duckdb_views().sql) with one fewer closing paren than memory or a v2.0.0 file shows for the same view; table SQL and constraints match. A v1.0.0-vs-v2.0.0 catalog check must not compare view SQL text.","type":"note"}]}
